/mxCell><mxCell id="n5" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="40" y="121" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="1880" y="121" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;R23 “지난번 네가 설명한 평가 기준에 맞춰, 앞서 조사한 제품 비교 결과와 받아둔 견적을 이번 제안서에 반영해줘.”&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="135" width="1840" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;같은 원본 / 현재 T23 연결은 판단 결과 / VIA: 허용 근거 연결, Agent: 기준 적용과 제안서 작성&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="168" width="1840" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;A 원본 서비스 조합형&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="158" y="192" width="820" height="32.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;현재 요청의 owner 읽기 결과 조합 / 누락 해결&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="158" y="226" width="820" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;B 공통 파생 기억 저장소형&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1028" y="192" width="820" height="32.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;과거 관계 생산 / 검증 / 게시 / 공통 읽기 계약 소비&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1028" y="226" width="820" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><mxPoint as="sourcePoint" x="990" y="195" /><mxPoint as="targetPoint" x="990" y="795" /><Array as="points" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;장면: 첫 요청 → 필요한 원본 / 미게시 생산 | 반복 R24 → warm cache / 유효 게시 | 정정 직후 → fence 후 갱신 | 표현 밖 새 관계 → 미지원&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="786" width="1840" height="20.8" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=0.75;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="130.0" y="815.0" width="112.5" height="24.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" parent="n14" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.17;&quot;&g